  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Delete TACOTS Recommendation Record
  
  Permanently deletes a single TACOTS recommendation record by its unique identifier. Associated Cloudinary assets (passport photo and last result) are also deleted. The corresponding cache entry is invalidated.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `delete` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                                |
  |-----------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS recommendation record   |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Confirms the recommendation record has been deleted.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `delete` permission.                 |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
